      "mergeID": "6352e82c1fb94045169b26e6",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When you open the Chatbox and you get tp in a game, the Chatbox doesn't allow you to move or open your menu. Even pressing the menu button to close it doesn't work since the function got disabled for idk reasons. I had to restart my entire game since i wasn't even able to move, open menues (including the dashboard and the quick action menu) and move anywhere.\nHow to do the glitch:\n1- Go in a world that has an auto tp option (like Murder 4 for example)\n2- Open the Chatbox keyboard just before you get tp by the game\n3- Goodluck reaching your keyboard or get your controls back",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Soft Lock with the Chatbox keyboard.",
