  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you have the chatbox open and your avatar gets teleported somewhere else in a world, it stays open and becomes impossible to close due to distance. This currently leaves you unable to move at all.\nAn easy fix would be able to close the keyboard with the menu button, (It worked like this with the previous menu.)\nPossibly adding a feature to close it when it moves too far from your playspace might also be beneficial.",
